---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import swatches from "../assets/estela/lip-color-swatches-retouched.png";
import videoPoster from "../assets/estela/color-blending-detail-poster.jpg";
import mixing from "../assets/estela/lip-color-mixing-retouched.png";
---

<section class="studio-section section-pad" id="studio" aria-labelledby="studio-title">
  <div class="section-heading compact-heading">
    <p class="section-kicker" data-animate>Behind the blend</p>
    <div>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="studio-title" data-animate>A little pigment.<br />A personal shade.</h2>
      <p class="studio-intro" data-animate>
        A closer look at the hands-on process: adding pigment, exploring shades,
        and testing color on skin.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="studio-media-grid">
    <div class="studio-process-column">
    <figure class="studio-feature">
      <div class="studio-video-wrap">
        <video
          controls
          playsinline
          muted
          preload="none"
          poster={videoPoster.src}
          width="478"
          height="400"
          aria-label="A look at the custom lip color blending process"
          aria-describedby="studio-video-description"
          data-video="estela-color-blending"
        >
          <source src="/videos/estela-color-blending-detail.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          <a href="/videos/estela-color-blending-detail.mp4">Watch the color blending video</a>.
        </video>
      </div>
      <figcaption id="studio-video-description">
        <span class="studio-number">01 / In motion</span>
        <h3>Color, drop by drop.</h3>
        <p>A brief, silent look at pigment being added to the mixing palette.</p>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <figure class="studio-feature studio-mixing">
      <Image
        src={mixing}
        alt="A spatula blending a custom brick-red lip color on a mixing palette"
        widths={[480, 720]}
        sizes="(max-width: 720px) calc(100vw - 2rem), 400px"
        quality={85}
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <figcaption>
        <span class="studio-number">02 / The blend</span>
        <h3>Mixed with intention.</h3>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    </div>

    <figure class="studio-feature">
      <Image
        src={swatches}
        alt="Six custom lip color swatches on the back of a hand, beside red pigment and mixed shades on a work surface"
        class="studio-photo"
        widths={[480, 720, 1080]}
        sizes="(max-width: 720px) calc(100vw - 2rem), 500px"
        quality={85}
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <figcaption>
        <span class="studio-number">03 / On the skin</span>
        <h3>See the shade come to life.</h3>
        <p>From the mixing palette to a skin swatch, each color has its own character.</p>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .studio-section {
    background: #f4e7e4;
    border-block: 1px solid rgba(141, 24, 56, 0.12);
    scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--header-height) + 1rem);
  }

  .studio-intro {
    max-width: 35rem;
    margin: 1.2rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .studio-media-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.75fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    width: min(900px, 100%);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .studio-feature {
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .studio-process-column {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 2rem;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .studio-mixing img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .studio-video-wrap {
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #35222a;
  }

  video {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 478 / 400;
  }

  video:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--color-berry);
    outline-offset: -3px;
  }

  .studio-photo {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  figcaption {
    padding: 1.3rem 0 0;
  }

  .studio-number {
    color: var(--color-berry);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  h3 {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-wine);
    font: 600 clamp(1.8rem, 2.5vw, 2.3rem) / 1.1 "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
  }

  figcaption p {
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
    max-width: 31rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .studio-media-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      max-width: 440px;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
